   :reading
   "The task runs the manifold-reader and prints the observation summary. The mission is a forward-model reader; the pattern extracts the deterministic dynamics core into a pure shared kernel that both the live step and the predictive call use — the reader is the pure-kernel consumer, reading the same manifold the live step would act on, with no shadow dynamics to drift.",
   :scope-limit
   "Covers the reader being the pure kernel's consumer; it does not validate the manifold data itself."},
